WEBVTT

00:22:59.582 --> 00:23:02.210
SM: Well, I think you just showed us
some of the passion

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:05.547
that you've talked about
as being the thing that gives you energy

00:23:05.547 --> 00:23:08.633
to lead that organization
of 1,300 people worldwide.

00:23:08.633 --> 00:23:10.885
Anjali, thank you so much 
for being here today.

00:23:10.885 --> 00:23:12.345
AS: Thank you. 
This was great.